We're excited to announce that applications are now open to event supervise for the 2027 MIT Science Olympiad Invitational on January 23, 2027!

The application for **all event supervisors** can be found [here](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd0R216jDh9H8WUSlapx9EDy-2_hMFDJQYr9fHI0fd_ofEYvw/viewform).

Applications will close on **September 25, 2026 at 11:59 PM EST**.

As always, feel free to reach out to us at [scioly@mit.edu](mailto:scioly@mit.edu) with any questions or concerns. We look forward to seeing you apply!
